 "_about": [
  "Joins the three vocabularies in this repository so a project type can be looked up in one place:",
  "the skill's job types (skills/oasis-blueprints/assets/views), the drawing-map project types and sheet kinds",
  "(library/drawing-map/taxonomy.json, sheet_kinds.json) and the detail categories (library/details/<collection>/index.json).",
  "It says where to look, not what a job needs. The drawing map counts what past sets contained and a library detail",
  "is the engineer's drawing: the engineer of record decides which sheets and details go on a set."
 ],
